        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89024979?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Add the <code class="notranslate">{{ReadOnlyInline}}</code> label to <code class="notranslate">Element.part</code> on the Element interface page, matching sibling read-only properties such as <code class="notranslate">Element.classList</code> and <code class="notranslate">Element.children</code>.</p>
