        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Added `overscroll-behavior: chain;` to shorthand and longhand properties]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45834</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45834"/>
        <updated>2026-09-24T08:56:15.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Updated the <code class="notranslate">overscroll-behavior</code> property page:
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Added <code class="notranslate">overscroll-behavior: chain;</code> to the Try it demo</li>
<li>Updated the values to be clearer about their behavior and added <code class="notranslate">chain</code></li>
<li>Added an example with <code class="notranslate">&lt;dialog&gt;</code>s that demonstrates each of the behaviors</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Updated the values to match <code class="notranslate">overscroll-behaivor</code> values on the following properties:
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">overscroll-behaivor-block</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">overscroll-behaivor-inline</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">overscroll-behaivor-x</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">overscroll-behaivor-y</code></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Moved the chat example from <code class="notranslate">overscroll-behaivor</code> to <code class="notranslate">overscroll-behaivor-y</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Working on <a href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45696" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/45696/hovercard">MDN issue #45696</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>All the values are the same on each of the properties so they only need reviewing the once.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
